# Layout n4x-1017-35-fp16: n4x-1017-35 before the INT8 indexer (2026-10-18): N4X's cards and draft head with DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-EXL3-3.5bpw on dev f157fc0b + #449 + #468 + #472
# (fork head 16d01882). Switch: ln -sfn layouts/n4x-1017-35-fp16.env ~/serve/ds41-exl3.env && sudo systemctl restart ds41-exl3
CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0,1,3,2
TABBY_EXL3_GENERATOR_CHUNK=16384
